  "_comment": "AUTHORITATIVE biome + world-generation contract. This file is the SINGLE source of truth: the runtime loads it live and generates ONLY the biomes, tiles, props, and mobs listed here. To add a biome, add an entry here (and run the asset import). Nothing tile/prop-wise generates outside this file.",
  "_assets": "tile/decoration paths are relative to the PixelArt library (C:/Projects/PixelArt). The strict importer copies ONLY the files referenced here into Assets/Art/Biomes and the loader resolves them by basename.",
  "_assignment": "Each cell has climate (temperature t, moisture m, elevation e), all 0..1. A biome matches when t/m/e all fall inside its climate box. On overlap, the first biome in 'priority' wins. If none match, 'fallbackBiome' is used.",
